---
title: "enterMarkets (Compound V2: Comptroller)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_iter: for cToken in cTokens
    q_iter --> q_check_listed: currentCToken = cTokens[i]
    q_check_listed --> q_not_listed: market not listed
    q_not_listed --> q_error: errors[i] = MARKET_NOT_LISTED
    q_error --> q_next: continue to next cToken
    q_check_listed --> q_check_entered: market is listed
    q_check_entered --> q_already: account already in market
    q_already --> q_next: errors[i] = NO_ERROR (idempotent)
    q_check_entered --> q_max_check: account not yet in market
    q_max_check --> q_too_many: accountAssets.length >= maxAssets
    q_too_many --> q_next: errors[i] = TOO_MANY_ASSETS
    q_max_check --> q_add: accountAssets.length < maxAssets
    q_add --> q_next: market.accountMembership[account] = true; accountAssets[account].push(cToken); emit MarketEntered; errors[i] = NO_ERROR
    q_next --> q_iter: i++; more cTokens
    q_next --> [*]: all cTokens processed; return errors

    note right of q_check_entered
        INV-001: Entering same market twice is not an error (idempotent)
        INV-002: Market must be listed in Comptroller to be entered
    end note

    note right of q_add
        INV-003: Account assets array grows by 1 for each new market entered
        INV-004: Entered markets count toward collateral in liquidity calculations
    end note
